{
  "_comment": "master_key / previous_keys: master key(s) wrapped with the KEK (output of ./encryptor wrap_key <plaintext-master-key>). connect1..connect5: MySQL DSNs encrypted with the master key (output of ./encryptor encrypt_bd \"user:pass@tcp(host:3306)/encryptor\"). The KEK itself is read from the file 'kek' next to the binary (chmod 600).",
